@base = http://localhost:3900/api
@tenant = acme
# A school admin's access token (auth.http → login), and a platform admin's
@token = paste-tenant-access-token
@platformToken = paste-platform-access-token

### The school's audit log, newest first (audit:read)
GET {{base}}/audit-logs?page=1&limit=20
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenant}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Lockouts (PRD 6.3: the admin can see these events)
GET {{base}}/audit-logs?action=auth.account_locked
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenant}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Every role and permission change in October
GET {{base}}/audit-logs?action=role.&from=2026-10-01T00:00:00Z&to=2026-11-01T00:00:00Z
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenant}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### History of one user (role assignments, admin rights, removal)
GET {{base}}/audit-logs?entityType=user&entityId=paste-user-id
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenant}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Platform audit log for one school (super-admin)
GET {{base}}/platform/audit-logs?orgId=paste-org-id
Authorization: Bearer {{platformToken}}
